@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@apiPrefix = /v1
@accessToken = your_access_token_here
@propertyId = 67584bd83344158428805f15

### Toggle Wishlist
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/wishlist/toggle/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Get Wishlist
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/wishlist?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ─── SECURITY SETTINGS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Change Password
# Note: Only works for accounts with a password set (not Google/OTP-only accounts)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "oldPassword123",
  "newPassword": "newPassword456"
}


### Update Contact (Email or Phone)
# Step 1: Call POST /auth/send-otp with the new email/phone to receive an OTP
# Step 2: Call this endpoint with the OTP + new contact details
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/update-contact
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "verificationCode": "123456",
  "email": "newemail@example.com"
}

### Update Contact - Phone
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/update-contact
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "verificationCode": "123456",
  "phone": {
    "countryCode": "+91",
    "number": "9876543210"
  }
}


### ─── IDENTITY VERIFICATION ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Upload Identity Document
# documentType: "aadhaar" | "pan" | "passport" | "drivingLicence"
# documentUrl: upload file via POST /media first, then pass the returned URL here
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/identity/upload
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "documentType": "passport",
  "documentUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/example/image/upload/doc.jpg"
}

### Upload Identity Document - Aadhaar
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/identity/upload
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "documentType": "aadhaar",
  "documentUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/example/image/upload/aadhaar.jpg"
}

### Upload Identity Document - PAN
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/identity/upload
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "documentType": "pan",
  "documentUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/example/image/upload/pan.jpg"
}

### Upload Identity Document - Driving Licence
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/identity/upload
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "documentType": "drivingLicence",
  "documentUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/example/image/upload/licence.jpg"
}

### Get Identity Verification Status
# Returns all submitted documents + overall verification status
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/identity/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ─── FEEDBACK ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Submit Feedback
# type: "bug" | "suggestion" | "complaint" | "other"
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "suggestion",
  "message": "It would be great to have a dark mode option in the app."
}


### ─── MY REVIEWS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get My Reviews (reviews submitted by the logged-in user)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/user/my-reviews?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
